    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adam</strong>, a former special forces operative, is assigned a top-secret mission: investigate a supposedly abandoned underground bio-research facility and extract evidence proving the government\u2019s involvement in funding a viral development program\u2014one that spiraled out of control and killed thousands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple data retrieval job quickly turns into a dangerous search. Most of the facility\u2019s personnel are dead\u2014casualties of brutal emergency protocols. Two scientists are missing, and Adam must track them through dark, hazardous corridors and Stormwater drain tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Adam follows their trail, unsettling signs and unexplained events make him question the true nature of his mission\u2014and his own connection to the facility.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game is somewhat similar to:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Evil Within</strong> \u2013 psychological horror and mind exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resident Evil</strong> \u2013 puzzles and atmospheric environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metro Exodus</strong> \u2013 radiation, underground tunnels, and survival weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/73728893082ab28336d6c3830b3086b2.poster.avif?t=1753966582\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/73728893082ab28336d6c3830b3086b2.webm?t=1753966582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/73728893082ab28336d6c3830b3086b2.mp4?t=1753966582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes This Game Unique?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original ideas\u2014not an imitation of any other game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI assistance integrated with the main character, set in an ancient fantasy world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning graphics with excellent visual performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse levels that introduce new challenges and enemies, avoiding repetition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaks the fourth wall, blending the virtual world with reality and engaging players directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/eb03f6fe0dfa56c83cd54a7652983ad0.poster.avif?t=1753966582\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/eb03f6fe0dfa56c83cd54a7652983ad0.webm?t=1753966582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/eb03f6fe0dfa56c83cd54a7652983ad0.mp4?t=1753966582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Will You Feel?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience something truly new\u2014like playing a Hideo Kojima game for the first time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>Early Access</strong> version. By purchasing now, you will:<br>\u2714 Enjoy an early experience.<br>\u2714 Save money by receiving the full release for free upon launch.<br>\u2714 Support ongoing development efforts.</p>",
